{"id":"103ef7b4129ffc8e","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-elementary-substructure.md","title":"初等子结构","display":"df-elementary-substructure — 初等子结构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-elementary-substructure","aliases":["29-df-elementary-substructure"],"display":"df-elementary-substructure — 初等子结构","depends_on":["[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-substructure]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-elementary-substructure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-elementary-substructure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-substructure — 初等子结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c407bfcc6de5b0d\" href=\"?note=6c407bfcc6de5b0d\" title=\"29-df-substructure\">29-df-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-elementary-substructure-—-初等子结构-$\\preceq$\">df-elementary-substructure — 初等子结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq\">\\(\\preceq\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq_\\tau A\">\\(B\\subseteq_\\tau A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6c407bfcc6de5b0d\" href=\"?note=6c407bfcc6de5b0d\" title=\"29-df-substructure\">29-df-substructure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)\\)</span> 及满足关系采用所列依赖；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to|B|\">\\(\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to|B|\\)</span> 同时经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|B|\\subseteq|A|\">\\(|B|\\subseteq|A|\\)</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上的赋值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\preceq_\\tau A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ B\\subseteq_\\tau A\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)\\;(B\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\preceq_\\tau A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ B\\subseteq_\\tau A\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)\\;(B\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\preceq A\\coloneqq B\\preceq_\\tau A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\preceq A\\coloneqq B\\preceq_\\tau A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条沿用有限结构范围。修正原来同时使用未绑定词汇S与τ、未定义裸结构包含符号的问题；子结构与公式词汇必须一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-elementary-substructure-—-初等子结构-$\\preceq$","text":"df-elementary-substructure — 初等子结构 $\\preceq$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"6c407bfcc6de5b0d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"6c407bfcc6de5b0d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau$ 为有限词汇，$A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$；$B\\subseteq_\\tau A$ 见 [[29-df-substructure]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\preceq","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq_\\tau A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to|B|","display":false},{"tex":"|B|\\subseteq|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B\\preceq_\\tau A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ B\\subseteq_\\tau A\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)\\;(B\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).","display":true},{"tex":"B\\preceq A\\coloneqq B\\preceq_\\tau A.","display":true}],"bytes":1146,"backlinks":[{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-elementary-substructure]]"}],"outgoing":["4de8e0c8085801f5","6c407bfcc6de5b0d","a3fa1d78e657e6a2","ac5c4072279f0088","3ee556c64b16809b"]}